WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A pendulum can move even when its holder
never intended to swing it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The movement is real.
But the explanation still needs evidence.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Zen12 sells a structured library: twelve levels
and forty-eight MP3 recordings in the complete course.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000
That tells us what is included—not whether the recording
delivers the seller's promises about your mind.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute routine first.
Then compare the actual contents, terms and proof
before you decide whether to buy.
